        "research": {
            "topic": "Cortical Labs CL1 — biological computer with living human neurons in Singapore",
            "summary": "On August 17, 2026, DayOne, Cortical Labs and NUS Medicine launched Singapore's first biological data center prototype: a server rack of 20 CL1 units, each running ~800,000 lab-grown human neurons on a silicon electrode chip at roughly 30 watts per unit.",
